  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "bc_autograd",
      "lane": "python",
      "step": 0,
      "title": "loss.backward() 触发反向",
      "subtitle": "autograd → Function.backward",
      "symbol": "_MegaMoeBF16TrainFunction.backward",
      "description": [
        "训练代码先用 y 构造 loss，再执行 loss.backward()。autograd 沿计算图算出 dL/dY，并将它作为 grad_y 传给 _MegaMoeBF16TrainFunction.backward(ctx, grad_y)。",
        "Module 的 forward 在调用 Function.apply 时已建立这个节点与输出 y 的关系，因此这里由 autograd 引擎直接调度 Function.backward。",
        "统一测试直接执行 y.backward(dy)，为每个 y 元素指定上游梯度。这等价于构造 loss=(y*dy).sum() 再反向。counts 已标记不可微；本算子为 x、p、W1、W2 返回梯度。"
      ],
      "reads": [
        "grad_y [M,H]",
        "ctx"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "反向Host调用"
      ],
      "waits": [],
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "experiments/megamoe_train/python/deep_ep_experimental/megamoe_train/bf16.py",
          "anchor": "    def backward(ctx, grad_y, grad_counts=None):",
          "before": 2,
          "after": 18
        },
        {
          "path": "experiments/megamoe_train/tests/bf16/test_mega_moe.py",
          "anchor": "    with phase(\"fused_forward_backward\"):",
          "before": 1,
          "after": 9
        }
      ],
      "formula": "y, counts = op(...)\ny.backward(dy)\n\nautograd → Function.backward(ctx, grad_y=dy)\n         → op._executor.backward(...)"
    },
    {
      "id": "bc_saved",
      "lane": "memory",
      "step": 1,
      "title": "恢复本次前向的保存Tensor",
      "subtitle": "状态、packed X/p、参数与计数",
      "symbol": "ctx.saved_tensors",
      "description": [
        "ctx取回与该前向对应的weights、W1、W2、counts、saved_state和dispatch_output。grad_y被整理为连续Tensor后进入执行器。saved-bf16包含原始Gate/Up，反向因此跳过GMM1重算；none/mxfp8的差异在内核分支中处理。"
      ],
      "reads": [
        "p、W1、W2、counts",
        "saved_state、dispatch_output",
        "grad_y"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "连续grad_y、反向输入引用"
